Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?feat(feed):=20issue=20=E2=86=92=20amend=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=86=92=20lock=20lifecycle=20for=20feed=20direction=20sheets?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Feed Direction was a live calculator: /feed-direction/preview computed a sheet for
ANY target_date on every request, so tomorrow (and September) returned an identical
confident 182 kg, a past sheet could not be retrieved, and the 14:00 correction had
nothing to correct. It is now an ISSUED, FROZEN document with a scheduled lifecycle,
driven off feed_schedule_config (which nothing read before).

Migration 000007
- feed_direction_issues: one live issue per (tenant, park, feed_day, workflow) via a
  partial unique index; state issued|amended|locked with shape checks (amended ⇒
  amended_at, locked ⇒ locked_at); an input fingerprint for replay/change detection;
  a separate idempotency index.
- feed_direction_issue_rows: the WHOLE generated scope frozen, so past reads and
  pagination serve stored rows. quantity_kg NULL iff blocked, 0.000 for authored zero
  — the blocked-vs-zero invariant is preserved through persist → serve.

Lifecycle (backend/internal/feeddirection/app/lifecycle.go), each op one transaction,
idempotent on a persisted key + fingerprint, reusing the verified generation math:
- Issue(asOf): feed_day = businessDate(asOf)+1, generate full scope, freeze.
- Amend(asOf): regenerate, diff row-by-row, write only changed sheds, state=amended.
  No change ⇒ recorded as unchanged, not a fabricated amendment. Refused once locked.
- Lock(asOf): state=locked. Idempotent.

Read path (Preview / PackingWorklist):
- issued date → serves STORED rows + lifecycle {state, issued_at, amended_at,
  locked_at, amendment_count}; whole-scope summary, invariant to page size.
- future date, not yet issued → explicit pending state naming WHEN it issues
  ("normal at 2026-07-29T07:00+05:30"), never a speculative sheet.
- past/current with no issue → honest never-issued state, no live recompute.
- draft=true → the ONLY path that live-computes, for config authoring, labelled draft.

Worker backend/cmd/feed-direction-issue (-action issue|amend|lock), registered in
deploy/runtime/workers.json and the image build; idempotent, safe to re-run.

Proven end to end against the live DB: serve 07-30 pending → issue → serve issued with
182.000 kg concentrate from 590 stored rows → amend → lock → amend-after-lock refused.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
